Package: MBE
Title: Bayesian Endpoints with Two Surrogate Outcomes
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Hyejung", "Lee", , "hyejung.lee@utah.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits a trial-level Bayesian model for exactly two surrogate
    endpoints and one clinical endpoint, then updates the historical posterior
    with results from a new randomized clinical trial. The package provides
    fixed- and random-intercept Stan models and importance-sampling tools for
    estimating the resulting Multi-Component Bayesian Endpoint.
